Profile: school
Description: Office, mail, maths and typing, for school and for work
# Useful at school and at a job, not a subject catalogue: a
# document, a spreadsheet, a talk, an inbox, a signed PDF, a graph.
# The browser and the PDF viewer are already on every desktop.
#
# GeoGebra has no Fedora or Debian package; Flathub carries the
# official one.
Requires: word-processor,
 spreadsheet,
 presentation,
 mail-client,
 pdf-annotator,
 typing-tutor,
 spell-check-english,
 geogebra,
 web-browser,
 document-viewer
Flatpak: geogebra=org.geogebra.GeoGebra
